# funr2_greedy.dem — pp-playtest-fun R2, strategy 2: GREEDY (the hoard
# CONTROL). Doctrine (declared up front, round-1 comparable): minimum spine,
# every tile not spent is profit — the MINIMUM LEGAL mesh: 4 routers (the
# 4-port cap admits no fewer), 12 legs (one trunk hop dropped), all standard,
# then HOARD: zero investment for the rest of the run. This is the control
# that proves the death clock's teeth survive the fix (an ignored breach must
# still die — the #115 guard); its CSV also times the breach/dip for the
# panic variant. Expect: era 3 fires when healthy, the arrival breach latches,
# the 45 s grace expires, the unchanged E16 drain empties the meter ->
# Run_Lost.
seed 2026
run 152000ms
era 2
health on
win surge 90
box on
advance gate on
fixture off
spawn_node residential 4 10
spawn_node residential 4 22
spawn_node residential 12 8
spawn_node residential 14 24
spawn_node residential 18 8
spawn_node residential 20 24
spawn_node residential 26 8
spawn_node residential 30 24
spawn_node small_biz 36 20
spawn_node content_host 36 26
spawn_node router_basic 8 16
spawn_node router_basic 16 16
spawn_node router_basic 24 16
spawn_node router_basic 32 16
# pipe ids (draw order): 0:0-10, 1:1-10, 2:2-10, 3:4-10, 4:3-11, 5:11-12,
# 6:5-12, 7:6-12, 8:12-13, 9:7-13, 10:8-13, 11:9-13
at 100ms draw 0 10 standard
at 100ms draw 1 10 standard
at 100ms draw 2 10 standard
at 100ms draw 4 10 standard
at 100ms draw 3 11 standard
at 100ms draw 11 12 standard
at 100ms draw 5 12 standard
at 100ms draw 6 12 standard
at 100ms draw 12 13 standard
at 100ms draw 7 13 standard
at 100ms draw 8 13 standard
at 100ms draw 9 13 standard

# PANIC-LATE: the same burst at the DIP (80.9 s — post-expiry drain already
# running, ~2.5 s of meter left). Round-1 GREEDY's signature move. If the
# drain outruns the 200-tick window slide, this dies anyway — the deadline
# is real and the panic window is IN the grace, not at its end.
at 80900ms modernize 0 wide
at 80900ms modernize 1 wide
at 80900ms modernize 2 wide
at 80900ms modernize 3 wide
at 80900ms modernize 4 wide
at 80900ms modernize 5 wide
at 80900ms modernize 6 wide
at 80900ms modernize 7 wide
at 80900ms modernize 8 wide
at 80900ms modernize 9 wide
at 80900ms modernize 10 wide
at 80900ms modernize 11 wide
expect hash stable
